            "display_title": "This paper proposes a graph neural network method that uses a convolution operation with decomposed, low-rank filters. Robustness against data perturbation or missing data is fulfilled by local graph regularization. ",
            "replying_to": "Replying to Graph Convolution with Low-rank Learnable Local Filters"
          }
